ticles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPa3A2cVFYb0FidXVXeVN1Xy1femh4OGlvY3dkNlBIQ05fekRiSzNvQ2l1bTZhcHlHd0VFenA2WnNqd1RHWFFtMDlMVXR2dE5QY1UwRm5yVjBMR3k2MWRiV2c1Q1FPWDJkREtIcWQxNmRaZDV3NmVMMzZpSjQxd1RBdzhiNGhEQUQ2LXJacGRZWXhQckxkVHhMMnNuRlhIVmR2Rk9JWERQTkZMNzFB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"GoDaddy（NYSE：GDDY）2026 年第三季銷售額最高預期"},{"title":"GoDaddy (NYSE:GDDY) Q3 2026: Revenue In Line, EPS Ahead","src":"ChartMill","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQUlRwZHZhbm1qczdPQ3FaNnVDRkpXbDd3N3ByQXBPYTZWZG83XzUxdk1MYWItRGZNVV8xOENaS29NMEJ6VVNfM0ktaTZKVzRILS1FN2x3akZVNEFIaFFxY3ZJdnJRUGdYZEJ2S0txZGFCejVXVjAtZXVyMHlRMEQ3bFdqa0dEbV90WjhlYjA2RzhJT010b2pMLXBHR3FMV3JJaGFqbQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"GoDaddy（NYSE：GDDY）2026 年第三季：營收符合預期，每股盈餘領先"},{"title":"[GoDaddy Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Airo Annualized Bookings Run Rate Tops $100 Million, Doubling in a Single Quarter as AI Product Turns Incremental to Growth","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGUjlDek9GakhQb1FnTjNxSnAtejJrV05hYmNJSWFpbDFtMXFnYlg4M1hnVV9SazZ4TEt0dF9mU3lHRVotcTE3eUNtMUtBN1dWWHNVOVRDUWJ1QnM3aGc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[GoDaddy 2026 年第三季財報電話會議]Airo 年化預訂運行率突破 1 億美元，單季翻倍，人工智慧產品由增量轉向成長"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1609711/000160971126000010/gddy-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"GoDaddy is a global leader serving a large market of entrepreneurs, developing and delivering easy-to-use solutions as a one-stop shop provider, backed by proactive, informed and personalized guidance. We serve small businesses, individuals, organizations, developers, designers and domain investors. Our vision is to radically shift the global economy toward life-fulfilling entrepreneurial ventures. Our mission is to empower entrepreneurs everywhere, making opportunity more inclusive for all. We are passionate about our mission and honored that entrepreneurs trust us with their ideas. Our 20.4 million customers are passionate and determined to transform their ideas into something meaningful. Our ability to evolve and build solutions and tools to handle our customers' fundamental jobs to be done uniquely positions us to help them navigate their individual journeys.","zh":null},{"en":"Each customer's journey is unique and they tend to be non-linear and iterative in nature. We design our solutions and tools to help our customers across all aspects of their businesses and to assist them in growing across what we call the \"Entrepreneur's Wheel.\" The Entrepreneur's Wheel represents our customers' needs within three main focus areas: Identity, Presence and Commerce.","zh":null},{"en":"Our customers often start with the most intimate of brand considerations, their Identity, which includes their company name, domain name, logo and email address. Choosing a domain name is often an important initial step for customers as they start and grow their business. We provide the solutions they need to support the establishment of their brand with our domain services and our suite of AI-powered tools including GoDaddy Airo (Airo), which can assist with searching for the perfect domain name, generating a unique logo, building a customized website, establishing a domain-specific email and more.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"GoDaddy is built to serve the needs of customers by providing easy-to-use products on an integrated technology platform wrapped with proactive, informed and personalized guidance.","zh":null},{"en":"We serve several customer populations: (i) Independents, (ii) WebPros, (iii) Domain Investors, and (iv) Domain Registrars, Third Party Registrars and Corporate Domain Portfolio owners. While these customer populations tend to utilize many of the same GoDaddy product offerings, there are meaningful differences in their journeys, what they value, their goals and how they communicate with their current and potential customers. We aim to establish and provide solutions that address these differences.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"We provide cloud-based solutions enabling individuals, businesses and organizations to establish an identity and online presence, connect with customers and manage their ventures and enable them to sell directly online, in-person and across multiple channels, backed by proactive, informed and personalized guidance. The market for our products and services is highly fragmented and competitive. These types of products and solutions continue to evolve, creating opportunity for new competitors to enter the market with point-solution products or address specific segments of the market. In some instances, we use commercial partnerships with companies with which we also compete. Additionally, as we continue to enable our solutions and tools with AI, and as technology continues to rapidly evolve, including with respect to AI and LLMs, we anticipate we will face more competition in the markets in","zh":null},{"en":"With respect to our A&C products and services: Shopify, Block, BigCommerce, Stripe, PayPal, Liquid Web, SiteGround, WP Engine, Zoho, Mindbody, Toast, Yelp, OpenTable, TikTok, Meta and WeChat;","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Core Platform","val":3062100000,"zh":"Core Platform"},{"name":"Applications & Commerce","val":1889000000,"zh":"Applications & Commerce"}],"total":4951100000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3324300000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1626800000,"zh":"Non Us"}],"total":4951100000}},"peers":["HUBS","IT","FICO","GWRE","BOX"]}}